  "details": "Discord has a nice feature where you can set statuses to expire after a certain amount of time and revert to green. This would be really great to have for statuses in VRChat as well.\n\nIt's not effortless to notice what status you're in if you're not actively looking for it. Personally I've gone orange at the end of the night to wind down only to forget I was still on orange for _days_ more times than I care to admit. 😓\n\nI feel like anything that can help push back the orange/red status tide is almost automatically a good idea at this point...",
